{"type":"message","id":"969ac156","parentId":"8f188fcd","timestamp":"2026-02-25T20:06:21.782Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_2ac69efac412492889c70565","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Windows PowerShell terminated with the following error: \r\n *g���R}��e�Nbz�^Ɩ System, Version=4.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=b77a5c561934e089 b�[�v�gN*N�OV�y�0The paging file is too small for this operation to complete. (_8^eg� HRESULT:0x800705AF)\n\n(Command exited with code 4294901760)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":4294901760,"durationMs":1075,"aggregated":"Windows PowerShell terminated with the following error: \r\n *g���R}��e�Nbz�^Ɩ System, Version=4.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=b77a5c561934e089 b�[�v�gN*N�OV�y�0The paging file is too small for this operation to complete. (_8^eg� HRESULT:0x800705AF)\n\n(Command exited with code 4294901760)","cwd":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772049981776}}
{"type":"message","id":"7cc0b239","parentId":"969ac156","timestamp":"2026-02-25T20:06:26.666Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                          系统内存不足，Gateway无法启动。但这不影响我们测试MCP服务器！\n\n大王，**MCP服务器已经成功运行**在端口18789，WebSocket端点：`ws://127.0.0.1:18789/extension`\n\n现在需要：\n\n1. **安装浏览器扩展** - 加载autoclaw文件夹到Chrome/Edge\n2. **配置Gateway Token** - 使用配置文件中的Token\n3. **测试连接** - 点击扩展图标进行授权\n\n您需要我帮您安装扩展吗？还是先检查扩展代码？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":29266,"output":121,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29387,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772049981783}}
{"type":"message","id":"1a3de77a","parentId":"7cc0b239","timestamp":"2026-02-25T20:09:09.330Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"0ba4b6c2-3a1d-4f89-b41e-0db6d8feb1a1\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"sender\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Thu 2026-02-26 04:09 GMT+8] 确认授权（**小时）应该改成 倒计时 颜色也要更换下 不然和上面的 确认授权按钮混淆了"}],"timestamp":1772050149326}}
{"type":"message","id":"adb679d3","parentId":"1a3de77a","timestamp":"2026-02-25T20:09:27.367Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"明白了大王！您说的是扩展界面中\"确认授权（**小时）\"的显示问题，需要改成倒计时显示并更换颜色避免混淆。\n\n让我检查扩展的源代码"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_887f2086054242e5984f73d8","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/skills/claw-browser/autoclaw/popup.html"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":29510,"output":69,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29579,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772050149329}}
{"type":"message","id":"00fac5d8","parentId":"adb679d3","timestamp":"2026-02-25T20:09:27.382Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_887f2086054242e5984f73d8","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <title>autoclaw</title>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n    body { width: 320px; padding: 12px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif; background: #f5f5f5; }\n    .header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n    .logo { width: 24px; height: 24px; font-size: 12px; background: #4CAF50; color: white; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; flex-shrink: 0; }\n    .status-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; }\n    .status-dot.authorized { background: #4CAF50; }\n    .status-dot.unauthorized { background: #9E9E9E; }\n    .status-dot.connecting { background: #F59E0B; }\n    h1 { font-size: 14px; color: #333; }\n    .card { background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n    .card h3 { font-size: 11px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }\n    button { width: 100%; padding: 10px; border: none; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n    button.primary { background: #4CAF50; color: white; }\n    button.primary:hover { background: #45a049; }\n    button.primary.active { background: #1976D2; }\n    button.secondary { background: #2196F3; color: white; }\n    button.secondary:hover { background: #1976D2; }\n    button:disabled { background: #ccc; cursor: not-allowed; }\n    .info { font-size: 12px; color: #666; text-align: center; margin-top: 8px; }\n    .info a { color: #2196F3; text-decoration: none; }\n    .tabs-info { font-size: 11px; color: #666; margin-top: 6px; text-align: center; }\n    .mode-badge {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 2px 8px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      margin-left: 8px;\n    }\n    .mode-badge.auto { background: #e3f2fd; color: #1976D2; }\n    .checkbox-container {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n      padding: 8px;\n      background: #f5f5f5;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .checkbox-container input { width: 16px; height: 16px; cursor: pointer; }\n    .checkbox-container span { font-size: 12px; color: #333; }\n    .error-message {\n      display: none;\n      padding: 8px 12px;\n      background: #fee2e2;\n      border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      color: #dc2626;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .error-message.show { display: block; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"logo\">AC</div>\n    <h1>autoclaw 控制器</h1>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h3>连接状态</h3>\n    <div id=\"errorMessage\" class=\"error-message\"></div>\n    <div id=\"connectionStatus\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 10px;\">检查中...</div>\n    <button id=\"toggleBtn\" class=\"primary\">点击授权/断开</button>\n    <div id=\"autoAttachStatus\" class=\"checkbox-container\" style=\"display: none;\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"autoAttachCheckbox\">\n      <span>自动控制所有标签页</span>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"tabsInfo\" class=\"tabs-info\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h3>快捷操作</h3>\n    <button id=\"openOptionsBtn\" class=\"secondary\">扩展设置</button>\n    <button id=\"refreshStatusBtn\" class=\"secondary\">刷新状态</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"info\">\n    首次授权后 <span id=\"authHoursDisplay\">24</span> 小时内有效<br>\n    <a href=\"#\" id=\"helpLink\">查看使用帮助</a>\n  </p>\n\n  <script src=\"popup.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772050167376}}
{"type":"message","id":"91fd67cd","parentId":"00fac5d8","timestamp":"2026-02-25T20:09:40.289Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          "},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3b2db732b1df4ecaa91b8ce6","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/skills/claw-browser/autoclaw/popup.js"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":30776,"output":33,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30809,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772050167383}}
{"type":"message","id":"48203ccb","parentId":"91fd67cd","timestamp":"2026-02-25T20:09:40.305Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_3b2db732b1df4ecaa91b8ce6","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// autoclaw popup - 浏览器自动化控制器\n\nconst DEFAULT_PORT = 18888;\nconst DEFAULT_AUTH_HOURS = 24;\nconst DEFAULT_MAX_TABS = 50;\n\nasync function getConfig() {\n  const stored = await chrome.storage.local.get([\n    'relayPort', 'gatewayToken', 'authTimestamp', 'authHours',\n    'autoAttachAll', 'openMode', 'maxTabs'\n  ]);\n  return {\n    port: Number(stored.relayPort) || DEFAULT_PORT,\n    token: String(stored.gatewayToken || '').trim(),\n    timestamp: Number(stored.authTimestamp) || 0,\n    authHours: Number(stored.authHours) || DEFAULT_AUTH_HOURS,\n    autoAttachAll: stored.autoAttachAll === true,\n    openMode: stored.openMode || 'current',\n    maxTabs: Number(stored.maxTabs) || DEFAULT_MAX_TABS\n  };\n}\n\nasync function isAuthValid() {\n  const { timestamp, authHours } = await getConfig();\n  if (!timestamp) return false;\n  return Date.now() < timestamp + (authHours * 60 * 60 * 1000);\n}\n\nfunction getAttachedTabsCount() {\n  return new Promise((resolve) => {\n    chrome.runtime.sendMessage({ action: 'getAttachedTabsCount' }, (response) => {\n      resolve(response?.count || 0);\n    });\n  });\n}\n\nfunction showError(message) {\n  const errorDiv = document.getElementById('errorMessage');\n  if (errorDiv) {\n    errorDiv.textContent = message;\n    errorDiv.style.display = 'block';\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      errorDiv.style.display = 'none';\n    }, 5000);\n  }\n}\n\nasync function updateStatus() {\n  const config = await getConfig();\n  const { timestamp, authHours, autoAttachAll, token } = config;\n  \n  const statusDot = document.getElementById('statusDot');\n  const connectionStatus = document.getElementById('connectionStatus');\n  const toggleBtn = document.getElementById('toggleBtn');\n  const autoAttachCheckbox = document.getElementById('autoAttachCheckbox');\n  const autoAttachStatus = document.getElementById('autoAttachStatus');\n  const tabsInfo = document.getElementById('tabsInfo');\n  const authHoursDisplay = document.getElementById('authHoursDisplay');\n\n  authHoursDisplay.textContent = authHours;\n\n  // 检查Token配置\n  if (!token) {\n    statusDot.className = 'status-dot unauthorized';\n    connectionStatus.innerHTML = '<span style=\"color: #f59e0b;\">请先配置 Token</span>';\n    toggleBtn.textContent = '去设置';\n    toggleBtn.disabled = false;\n    toggleBtn.onclick = () => chrome.runtime.openOptionsPage();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const tabs = await chrome.tabs.query({ active: true, currentWindow: true });\n  const activeTab = tabs[0];\n  const tabId = activeTab?.id;\n\n  if (!tabId) {\n    statusDot.className = 'status-dot unauthorized';\n    connectionStatus.textContent = '无活动标签页';\n    toggleBtn.disabled = true;\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const badgeText = await chrome.action.getBadgeText({ tabId });\n  const attachedCount = await getAttachedTabsCount();\n\n  if (badgeText === 'ON') {\n    statusDot.className = 'status-dot authorized';\n    const remaining = timestamp ? Math.round((timestamp + authHours * 3600000 - Date.now()) / 60000) : 0;\n    if (remaining > 0) {\n      connectionStatus.textContent = `已连接 (${remaining}分钟有效)`;\n    } else {\n      connectionStatus.textContent = '已连接';\n    }\n    toggleBtn.textContent = attachedCount > 1 ? `已控制 ${attachedCount} 个标签页` : '断开连接';\n    toggleBtn.disabled = false;\n    toggleBtn.classList.add('active');\n    toggleBtn.onclick = null;\n  } else if (badgeText === '…') {\n    statusDot.className = 'status-dot connecting';\n    connectionStatus.textContent = '连接中...';\n    toggleBtn.disabled = true;\n    toggleBtn.onclick = null;\n  } else if (badgeText === '!') {\n    statusDot.className = 'status-dot error';\n    const isValid = await isAuthValid();\n    if (isValid) {\n      connectionStatus.innerHTML = '<span style=\"color: #f97316;\">连接失败，点击重试</span>';\n    } else {\n      connectionStatus.innerHTML = '<span style=\"color: #ef4444;\">授权已过期</span>';\n    }\n    toggleBtn.textContent = '重试连接';\n    toggleBtn.disabled = false;\n    toggleBtn.onclick = null;\n  } else {\n    statusDot.className = 'status-dot unauthorized';\n    const isValid = await isAuthValid();\n    if (isValid) {\n      connectionStatus.textContent = '点击授权控制页面';\n    } else {\n      connectionStatus.innerHTML = '<span style=\"color: #ef4444;\">授权已过期，请重新授权</span>';\n    }\n    toggleBtn.textContent = '点击授权';\n    toggleBtn.disabled = false;\n    toggleBtn.classList.remove('active');\n    toggleBtn.onclick = null;\n  }\n\n  // 更新自动控制状态\n  const authValid = await isAuthValid();\n  if (authValid) {\n    autoAttachStatus.style.display = 'flex';\n    autoAttachCheckbox.checked = autoAttachAll;\n    \n    if (autoAttachAll) {\n      tabsInfo.textContent = `自动控制: ${attachedCount}个标签页`;\n    } else {\n      tabsInfo.textContent = attachedCount > 0 ? `已控制 ${attachedCount} 个标签页` : '';\n    }\n  } else {\n    autoAttachStatus.style.display = 'none';\n  }\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('toggleBtn').addEventListener('click', async () => {\n  const config = await getConfig();\n  const autoAttachAll = config.autoAttachAll;\n  \n  // 显示加载状态\n  const toggleBtn = document.getElementById('toggleBtn');\n  const originalText = toggleBtn.textContent;\n  toggleBtn.textContent = '处理中...';\n  toggleBtn.disabled = true;\n  \n  try {\n    if (autoAttachAll) {\n      const response = await new Promise((resolve) => {\n        chrome.runtime.sendMessage({ action: 'autoAttachAllTabs' }, resolve);\n      });\n      \n      if (!response?.success && response?.error) {\n        showError(response.error);\n      }\n    } else {\n      const tabs = await chrome.tabs.query({ active: true, currentWindow: true });\n      if (tabs[0]?.id) {\n        chrome.action.onClicked.dispatch(tabs[0]);\n      }\n    }\n  } catch (err) {\n    showError(err.message || '操作失败');\n  }\n  \n  setTimeout(() => updateStatus(), 500);\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('openOptionsBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  chrome.runtime.openOptionsPage();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('refreshStatusBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  updateStatus();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('helpLink').addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n  e.preventDefault();\n  chrome.runtime.openOptionsPage();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('autoAttachCheckbox').addEventListener('change', async (e) => {\n  const autoAttachAll = e.target.checked;\n  await chrome.storage.local.set({ autoAttachAll: autoAttachAll });\n  \n  if (autoAttachAll) {\n    const response = await new Promise((resolve) => {\n      chrome.runtime.sendMessage({ action: 'autoAttachAllTabs' }, resolve);\n    });\n    \n    if (!response?.success && response?.error) {\n      showError(response.error);\n    }\n  }\n  \n  updateStatus();\n});\n\n// 定时刷新状态\nupdateStatus();\nsetInterval(updateStatus, 5000);\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772050180299}}
