{"type":"message","id":"5930adbe","parentId":"070f13af","timestamp":"2026-02-25T20:36:30.928Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_e018bce2d0c3403caed1460a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  const method = String(msg?.payload?.method || msg?.params?.method || '').trim();\n  const params = msg?.payload?.params || msg?.params || undefined;\n  const sessionId = typeof msg?.payload?.sessionId === 'string' ? msg.payload.sessionId : \n                    typeof msg?.params?.sessionId === 'string' ? msg.params.sessionId : undefined;\n  const startTime = Date.now();\n\n  try {\n    const bySession = sessionId ? getTabBySessionId(sessionId) : null;\n    const targetId = typeof params?.targetId === 'string' ? params.targetId : undefined;\n    const tabId = bySession?.tabId || (targetId ? getTabByTargetId(targetId) : null) ||\n      (() => {\n        for (const [id, tab] of tabs.entries()) {\n          if (tab.state === 'connected') return id;\n        }\n        return null;\n      })();\n\n    if (!tabId) {\n      throw new Error(`没有已附加的标签页: ${method}`);\n    }\n\n[243 more lines in file. Use offset=910 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772051790919}}
{"type":"message","id":"f9369324","parentId":"5930adbe","timestamp":"2026-02-25T20:36:51.976Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                    我发现了！**问题就在这里**：\n\n当`Target.createTarget`被调用时：\n1. 没有sessionId → `bySession?.tabId`为null\n2. 没有targetId → `getTabByTargetId(targetId)`为null  \n3. 所以执行fallback逻辑：**返回第一个已连接的标签页**\n\n这意味着：**无论设置如何，都可能在其他标签页中打开新页面**！\n\n## 🛠️ 解决方案\n\n需要修改逻辑，让`Target.createTarget`能够：\n1. **识别调用来源**（哪个标签页发起的请求）\n2. **正确传递tabId**（在当前标签页打开时）\n\n让我修改这个逻辑："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_98b9fef44a0e4611a471a0fb","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/skills/claw-browser/autoclaw/background.js","oldText":"    const tabId = bySession?.tabId || (targetId ? getTabByTargetId(targetId) : null) ||\n      (() => {\n        for (const [id, tab] of tabs.entries()) {\n          if (tab.state === 'connected') return id;\n        }\n        return null;\n      })();","newText":"    let tabId = bySession?.tabId || (targetId ? getTabByTargetId(targetId) : null);\n    \n    // 对于Target.createTarget，如果没有指定tabId，尝试获取活动标签页\n    if (!tabId && method === 'Target.createTarget') {\n      try {\n        const [activeTab] = await chrome.tabs.query({ active: true, currentWindow: true });\n        if (activeTab?.id && tabs.has(activeTab.id)) {\n          tabId = activeTab.id;\n        }\n      } catch (err) {\n        console.warn('获取活动标签页失败:', err);\n      }\n    }\n    \n    // 如果还是没有tabId，使用fallback逻辑\n    if (!tabId) {\n      tabId = (() => {\n        for (const [id, tab] of tabs.entries()) {\n          if (tab.state === 'connected') return id;\n        }\n        return null;\n      })();\n    }"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":77702,"output":491,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":78193,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772051790928}}
