{"type":"message","id":"15cfff93","parentId":"50aa54fd","timestamp":"2026-02-25T21:10:01.557Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5ed9f1944c264ae3a28ebbdb","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"manifest_version\": 3,\n  \"name\": \"autoclaw\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"OpenClaw 浏览器自动化控制器 - 点击一次控制所有标签页\",\n  \"icons\": {\n    \"16\": \"icons/icon16.png\",\n    \"32\": \"icons/icon32.png\",\n    \"48\": \"icons/icon48.png\",\n    \"128\": \"icons/icon128.png\"\n  },\n  \"permissions\": [\n    \"debugger\",\n    \"tabs\",\n    \"activeTab\",\n    \"storage\",\n    \"bookmarks\"\n  ],\n  \"host_permissions\": [\n    \"http://127.0.0.1/*\",\n    \"http://localhost/*\"\n  ],\n  \"background\": {\n    \"service_worker\": \"background.js\",\n    \"type\": \"module\"\n  },\n  \"action\": {\n    \"default_title\": \"autoclaw - 点击授权/控制浏览器\",\n    \"default_icon\": {\n      \"16\": \"icons/icon16.png\",\n      \"32\": \"icons/icon32.png\",\n      \"48\": \"icons/icon48.png\",\n      \"128\": \"icons/icon128.png\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"options_ui\": {\n    \"page\": \"options.html\",\n    \"open_in_tab\": true\n  }\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772053801548}}
{"type":"message","id":"ee2355aa","parentId":"15cfff93","timestamp":"2026-02-25T21:10:34.610Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                              Manifest配置正确！现在让我帮您安装扩展。在Chrome中安装扩展的步骤：\n\n## 📋 **安装步骤**\n\n1. **打开Chrome扩展页面**：`chrome://extensions/`\n2. **开启开发者模式**：右上角切换按钮\n3. **加载已解压的扩展**：点击\"加载已解压的扩展\"按钮\n4. **选择扩展目录**：选择 `C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\skills\\claw-browser\\autoclaw`\n\n## 🧪 **测试流程**\n\n安装完成后：\n\n1. **配置扩展**：点击扩展图标 → 选项\n2. **设置Token**：输入正确的Gateway Token\n3. **设置端口**：确保是18790（默认已设置）\n4. **授权连接**：点击扩展图标授权\n5. **测试导航**：尝试打开网址观察打开方式\n\n## 🔧 **如果遇到问题**\n\n- **端口冲突**：检查MCP服务器是否运行在18790\n- **连接失败**：确认Gateway Token正确\n- **打开方式错误**：检查配置中的\"打开模式\"设置\n\n大王，您需要我帮您执行具体的安装步骤吗？还是您希望我先检查某个特定的配置？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":90033,"output":266,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":90299,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772053801558}}
