{"type":"message","id":"54c6a9b6","parentId":"1c959f40","timestamp":"2026-02-25T21:12:33.020Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          浏览器控制服务不可用。让我用命令行方式打开扩展选项页面。\n\n大王，请您手动操作：\n\n## 📋 **配置扩展步骤**\n\n1. **打开Chrome扩展页面**：在地址栏输入 `chrome://extensions/`\n2. **找到autoclaw扩展**：在扩展列表中查找\n3. **点击\"详情\"或\"选项\"**：进入扩展配置页面\n4. **配置以下设置**：\n   - **端口**: `18790`\n   - **Token**: 使用OpenClaw配置中的Token\n   - **授权时长**: 设置您需要的时长\n   - **打开模式**: 选择\"当前页打开\"\n\n## 🔑 **获取Token的方法**\n\n在终端运行：\n```bash\nopenclaw config get gateway.token\n```\n\n或者查看OpenClaw配置文件：\n```bash\ntype ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\n```\n\n配置完成后，点击扩展图标进行授权，然后我们就可以测试页面打开功能了！🔥"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":87779,"output":206,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87985,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772053934919}}
