{"type":"message","id":"b2a7ecc8","parentId":"5900b907","timestamp":"2026-02-25T21:32:14.926Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                                                 我看到问题了！`convertToolToCDP`函数**没有处理收藏夹相关的工具**，它只处理了：\n\n- `claw_navigate`\n- `claw_click_element` \n- `claw_fill_input`\n- 其他工具都 fallback 到 `Runtime.evaluate`\n\n这意味着收藏夹工具**没有被真正实现**，只是返回了一个console.log！\n\n让我添加收藏夹工具的支持"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7c23a992b285441096de0dec","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/skills/claw-browser/autoclaw-mcp/src/index.ts","oldText":"    case 'claw_fill_input':\n      return {\n        method: 'Input.insertText',\n        params: {\n          text: args.text,\n          selector: args.selector\n        }\n      };\n    default:\n      return {\n        method: 'Runtime.evaluate',\n        params: {\n          expression: `console.log(\"Tool ${toolName} called with args:\", ${JSON.stringify(args)})`\n        }\n      };","newText":"    case 'claw_fill_input':\n      return {\n        method: 'Input.insertText',\n        params: {\n          text: args.text,\n          selector: args.selector\n        }\n      };\n    case 'claw_get_bookmarks':\n      return {\n        method: 'Storage.getBookmarks',\n        params: {}\n      };\n    case 'claw_get_bookmark_tree':\n      return {\n        method: 'Storage.getBookmarkTree',\n        params: {}\n      };\n    case 'claw_search_bookmarks':\n      return {\n        method: 'Storage.searchBookmarks',\n        params: {\n          query: args.query\n        }\n      };\n    case 'claw_open_bookmark':\n      return {\n        method: 'Storage.openBookmark',\n        params: {\n          keyword: args.keyword\n        }\n      };\n    case 'claw_create_bookmark_folder':\n      return {\n        method: 'Storage.createBookmarkFolder',\n        params: {\n          folderName: args.folderName\n        }\n      };\n    case 'claw_delete_bookmark':\n      return {\n        method: 'Storage.deleteBookmark',\n        params: {\n          bookmarkId: args.bookmarkId\n        }\n      };\n    case 'claw_move_bookmark':\n      return {\n        method: 'Storage.moveBookmark',\n        params: {\n          bookmarkId: args.bookmarkId,\n          newParentId: args.newParentId\n        }\n      };\n    case 'claw_categorize_bookmark':\n      return {\n        method: 'Storage.categorizeBookmarks',\n        params: {\n          keywords: args.keywords,\n          folderName: args.folderName\n        }\n      };\n    default:\n      return {\n        method: 'Runtime.evaluate',\n        params: {\n          expression: `console.log(\"Tool ${toolName} called with args:\", ${JSON.stringify(args)})`\n        }\n      };"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":94800,"output":723,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95523,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772055096995}}
