{"type":"message","id":"2ad9af7f","parentId":"dd767696","timestamp":"2026-02-25T21:33:25.344Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                         看起来浏览器扩展**没有实现Storage相关的CDP命令**！\n\n## 📋 **当前状态**\n\n### ✅ **MCP服务器端**：\n- 定义了收藏夹相关的工具\n- 工具调用会转换为CDP命令\n\n### ❌ **浏览器扩展端**：\n- 没有实现Storage协议的处理\n- CDP命令会失败或不被识别\n\n## 🛠️ **需要实现的功能**\n\n在`handleForwardCdpCommand`函数中添加：\n\n```javascript\n// 书签管理命令\nif (method === 'Storage.getBookmarks') {\n  return await chrome.bookmarks.getTree();\n}\n\nif (method === 'Storage.searchBookmarks') {\n  const bookmarks = await chrome.bookmarks.search({ query: params.query });\n  return bookmarks;\n}\n\nif (method === 'Storage.openBookmark') {\n  const bookmarks = await chrome.bookmarks.search({ query: params.keyword });\n  if (bookmarks.length > 0) {\n    await chrome.tabs.update({ url: bookmarks[0].url });\n  }\n}\n// ... 其他书签操作\n```\n\n大王，收藏夹工具已经定义好了，但**浏览器扩展端还需要实现具体的CDP命令处理**。您希望我现在实现这些功能吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":93745,"output":262,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94007,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772055175015}}
