{"type":"message","id":"1cb0d43f","parentId":"5736c49f","timestamp":"2026-02-25T21:37:13.393Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                      🎉 **MCP服务器启动成功！**\n\n## ✅ **收藏夹功能已实现**\n\n### 🛠️ **实现的内容**\n\n#### 1. **MCP服务器端** (`index.ts`)\n- ✅ 添加了所有收藏夹工具的CDP命令转换\n- ✅ `claw_get_bookmarks` → `Storage.getBookmarks`\n- ✅ `claw_search_bookmarks` → `Storage.searchBookmarks`\n- ✅ `claw_open_bookmark` → `Storage.openBookmark`\n- ✅ `claw_create_bookmark_folder` → `Storage.createBookmarkFolder`\n- ✅ `claw_delete_bookmark` → `Storage.deleteBookmark`\n- ✅ `claw_move_bookmark` → `Storage.moveBookmark`\n- ✅ `claw_categorize_bookmark` → `Storage.categorizeBookmarks`\n\n#### 2. **浏览器扩展端** (`background.js`)\n- ✅ 实现了所有Storage协议的CDP命令处理\n- ✅ 使用Chrome原生bookmarks API\n- ✅ 支持搜索、打开、创建、删除、移动书签\n- ✅ 支持批量分类书签功能\n\n### 🎯 **可用功能**\n\n1. **获取书签**：获取所有书签的扁平列表或树形结构\n2. **搜索书签**：根据关键词搜索书签\n3. **打开书签**：根据关键词打开匹配的书签\n4. **管理书签**：创建文件夹、删除、移动书签\n5. **分类书签**：批量将书签分类到指定文件夹\n\n### 📋 **使用示例**\n\n```bash\n# 获取所有书签\nclaw_get_bookmarks\n\n# 搜索包含\"抖音\"的书签  \nclaw_search_bookmarks { \"query\": \"抖音\" }\n\n# 打开抖音书签\nclaw_open_bookmark { \"keyword\": \"抖音\" }\n\n# 创建新的书签文件夹\nclaw_create_bookmark_folder { \"folderName\": \"工作相关\" }\n```\n\n大王，收藏夹操作功能已经完整实现了！现在可以通过MCP工具来管理浏览器书签了。🔥"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":94001,"output":446,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94447,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772055399061}}
