{"type":"message","id":"f075bb97","parentId":"e6b050ed","timestamp":"2026-02-25T21:41:52.657Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                  找到了！Gateway Token是：`Q0hpK2oV4F9tlwbYX3RELxiJNGDvayr8OPqZzkfs`\n\n现在让我用正确的Token尝试WebSocket连接。但首先让我用更直接的方法 - 使用扩展的options页面来测试收藏夹搜索功能。\n\n大王，由于WebSocket连接需要复杂的认证，让我建议一个更直接的方法：\n\n## 📋 **测试收藏夹功能的建议**\n\n1. **打开扩展选项页面**：\n   - 在Chrome地址栏输入：`chrome://extensions/`\n   - 找到autoclaw扩展，点击\"选项\"\n   - 配置正确的Token：`Q0hpK2oV4F9tlwbYX3RELxiJNGDvayr8OPqZzkfs`\n   - 设置端口：`18790`\n\n2. **授权连接**：\n   - 点击扩展图标进行授权\n   - 确保连接状态显示为\"已连接\"\n\n3. **测试收藏夹搜索**：\n   - 使用命令：`claw_search_bookmarks {\"query\": \"即梦\"}`\n\n或者，如果您已经配置好了，我可以帮您检查连接状态并指导具体测试步骤。\n\n大王，您希望我继续尝试技术方法，还是先帮您配置扩展？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":96876,"output":277,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97153,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772055696237}}
{"type":"message","id":"c67738b3","parentId":"f075bb97","timestamp":"2026-02-25T21:43:51.191Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"c8c36531-5cc5-42a7-acad-3024ca984747\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"sender\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Thu 2026-02-26 05:43 GMT+8] 插件没问题 ，端口，token都没问题，但插件图标 点击无法显示 on"}],"timestamp":1772055831180}}
{"type":"message","id":"3cceafce","parentId":"c67738b3","timestamp":"2026-02-25T21:44:22.216Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          大王，这个问题很关键！插件图标点击无法显示\"ON\"状态，说明**WebSocket连接没有真正建立成功**。\n\n## 🔍 **问题分析**\n\n**现象**：插件图标不显示\"ON\"（授权状态）\n**原因**：WebSocket连接失败，可能是：\n\n1. **Token不匹配**：扩展配置的Token与Gateway Token不一致\n2. **端口错误**：扩展配置的端口不是18790\n3. **MCP服务器问题**：虽然运行但无法处理连接\n4. **网络限制**：防火墙或权限问题\n\n## 🛠️ **排查步骤**\n\n### 1. 检查扩展配置\n请确认扩展options页面中：\n- **端口**：`18790`（不是18888）\n- **Token**：`Q0hpK2oV4F9tlwbYX3RELxiJNGDvayr8OPqZzkfs`\n\n### 2. 检查MCP服务器日志\n让我查看MCP服务器的详细日志："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4282976eeb9840288e7a07a8","name":"process","arguments":{"action":"poll","sessionId":"tide-ridge","timeout":5000}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":97259,"output":246,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97505,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772055831189}}
