{"type":"message","id":"416f2645","parentId":"61ffcef0","timestamp":"2026-02-25T21:44:53.805Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                          从日志可以看到：\n\n1. **WebSocket客户端在连接**（很多连接尝试）\n2. **但缺少token参数**（扩展没有发送Token）\n3. **偶尔有token认证失败**（Token不匹配）\n\n## 🎯 **根本原因**\n\n**扩展没有正确发送Token**到WebSocket连接。这通常是因为：\n\n1. **扩展配置错误**：Token或端口设置不正确\n2. **扩展代码问题**：没有正确构造WebSocket URL\n3. **浏览器限制**：扩展权限问题\n\n## 🔧 **解决方案**\n\n### 1. **检查扩展配置**\n请确认扩展options页面中：\n- ✅ **端口**：`18790`（不是18888）\n- ✅ **Token**：`Q0hpK2oV4F9tlwbYX3RELxiJNGDvayr8OPqZzkfs`\n\n### 2. **检查扩展代码**\n让我查看扩展中WebSocket连接的代码"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5f0a6221cdc4453892811c33","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"Select-String -Path C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\skills\\claw-browser\\autoclaw\\background.js -Pattern \"new WebSocket|ws://\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":96347,"output":258,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96605,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772055867247}}
