{"type":"message","id":"f73687f0","parentId":"7c2a502e","timestamp":"2026-02-25T21:48:56.898Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"        大王英明！**简单直接最好**。让我回退到0909版本的架构，使用直连Gateway的方式。\n\n## 🛠️ **回退方案**\n\n### 1. 恢复直连Gateway\n```javascript\n// 改回直连18888端口\nconst WEBSOCKET_CONFIG = {\n  url: 'ws://127.0.0.1:18888/extension',\n  protocols: ['openclaw-v1'],\n  timeout: 5000,\n  reconnect: true\n};\n```\n\n### 2. 移除MCP服务器依赖\n- 不需要MCP服务器中转\n- 直接使用OpenClaw原生Gateway\n- 简化连接流程\n\n### 3. 保持功能完整性\n- 保留所有收藏夹功能\n- 保留页面打开优化\n- 保留实时倒计时\n\n## 🔧 **立即执行**\n\n让我修改background.js回退到直连模式："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_009b3f9133974f768c122e9e","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/skills/claw-browser/autoclaw/background.js","oldText":"const WEBSOCKET_CONFIG = {\n  url: 'ws://127.0.0.1:18790/extension',\n  protocols: ['openclaw-v1'],\n  timeout: 5000,","newText":"const WEBSOCKET_CONFIG = {\n  url: 'ws://127.0.0.1:18888/extension',\n  protocols: ['openclaw-v1'],\n  timeout: 5000,"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":102797,"output":336,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103133,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772056102416}}
