{"type":"message","id":"38f28d9f","parentId":"e32d353d","timestamp":"2026-02-25T21:56:48.615Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                            🎉 **MCP服务器启动成功！**\n\n## ✅ **最终架构确定**\n\n### 🎯 **使用MCP服务器架构**\n- **端口**：18790（固定）\n- **架构**：扩展 → MCP服务器 → Gateway\n- **优势**：更好的工具支持，更多功能\n\n### 📋 **用户配置**\n用户需要在扩展options页面设置：\n- ✅ **端口**：`18790` \n- ✅ **Token**：`Q0hpK2oV4F9tlwbYX3RELxiJNGDvayr8OPqZzkfs`\n\n### 📚 **清晰说明**\n已经在界面中添加：\n```\nWebSocket: ws://127.0.0.1:18790/extension\n📢 请确保端口与MCP服务器一致（当前:18790）\n```\n\n大王，现在架构稳定了！使用**MCP服务器+18790端口**，用户只需要按照说明配置即可。不再频繁改动，保持一致性！🔥"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":101877,"output":210,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102087,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772056579215}}
