{"type":"message","id":"f56107b3","parentId":"be875e8d","timestamp":"2026-02-26T03:38:33.557Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_04b69b9b7f944b2c90fc1ddc","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# autoclaw - OpenClaw 浏览器自动化工具\n\n基于 OpenClaw 原生扩展架构开发的浏览器自动化控制器，适配 OpenClaw MCP。\n\n## 核心特性\n\n- 🔐 **一次授权 1-99 小时可选** - 首次授权后，无需重复点击\n- 🌐 **直接连接 OpenClaw Gateway** - 端口 18888，Gateway Token 认证\n- 🎯 **Chrome Debugger API** - 使用原生 Debugger API，完全控制浏览器\n- 🔒 **本地运行** - 纯本地运行，无云端依赖\n- 🖱️ **Edge 兼容** - 支持 Chrome 和 Edge 浏览器\n- 📑 **全局自动控制** - 一次点击控制所有标签页\n- ⚡ **简单操作直接执行** - 复杂操作可走 MCP\n- 🔌 **插件名: autoclaw** - 标准插件名称\n\n---\n\n## 安装步骤\n\n### 第一步：安装 Chrome/Edge 扩展\n\n[280 more lines in file. Use offset=21 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772077113552}}
{"type":"message","id":"62e37bfb","parentId":"f56107b3","timestamp":"2026-02-26T03:40:06.712Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                       让我查看更多的README内容："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ba6b49435e6b43fbbe939681","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/skills/claw-browser/README.md","offset":50,"limit":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":48567,"output":47,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48614,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772077113557}}
{"type":"message","id":"f63fa159","parentId":"62e37bfb","timestamp":"2026-02-26T03:40:06.722Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ba6b49435e6b43fbbe939681","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**方法一：从 OpenClaw 配置获取**\n```bash\n# 查看 OpenClaw 配置\ncat ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\n\n# 找到 gateway.auth.token 的值\n```\n\n**方法二：首次运行 OpenClaw 时获取**\n```\nOpenClaw 首次启动会显示 Gateway Token，保存下来\n```\n\n---\n\n### 第三步：配置扩展授权\n\n1. 点击浏览器右上角的扩展图标\n2. 点击弹出窗口中的 **\"扩展设置\"**\n3. 在 \"Gateway Token\" 栏粘贴 Token\n4. 拖动滑块设置授权时长（1-99小时）\n5. 点击 **\"确认授权\"**\n\n> ✅ 授权成功后，设置的时长内无需再次授权\n\n---\n\n## 新功能说明\n\n### 1. 可自定义授权时长\n\n[221 more lines in file. Use offset=80 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772077206718}}
