{"type":"message","id":"2fcecff3","parentId":"d6b3d31a","timestamp":"2026-02-26T03:41:41.660Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                                                        现在让我更新README.md来引用新的路由规则"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_09b160dbf09d4dd99416dbba","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/skills/claw-browser/README.md","offset":200,"limit":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":50062,"output":52,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50114,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772077282023}}
{"type":"message","id":"a3656425","parentId":"2fcecff3","timestamp":"2026-02-26T03:41:41.673Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_09b160dbf09d4dd99416dbba","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n### Q: 找不到 Gateway Token？\n**A:** \n1. 运行 `openclaw gateway --port 18888` 会显示\n2. 或查看 `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json` 中的 `gateway.auth.token`\n\n---\n\n## 工作原理图\n\n\n[91 more lines in file. Use offset=210 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772077301668}}
{"type":"message","id":"c00f8a06","parentId":"a3656425","timestamp":"2026-02-26T03:42:24.019Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                     让我在README中添加架构说明"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_58293f3afe04459281363a65","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/skills/claw-browser/README.md","oldText":"## 工作原理图\n\n```\n+-------------+      +-------------------+      +-------------+\n|             |      |                   |      |             |\n|  浏览器扩展  +----->+  OpenClaw Gateway +----->+    AI助手   |\n|             |      |                   |      |             |\n+-------------+      +-------------------+      +-------------+\n```","newText":"## 工作原理图\n\n### 双架构支持\n\n#### 1. Gateway直连模式（端口：18888）\n```\n+-------------+      +-------------------+      +-------------+\n|             |      |                   |      |             |\n|  浏览器扩展  +----->+  OpenClaw Gateway +----->+    AI助手   |\n|             |      |     (18888)       |      |             |\n+-------------+      +-------------------+      +-------------+\n```\n\n#### 2. MCP服务器模式（端口：49666）\n```\n+-------------+      +-----------------+      +-------------------+      +-------------+\n|             |      |                 |      |                   |      |             |\n|  浏览器扩展  +----->+  MCP服务器      +----->+  OpenClaw Gateway +----->+    AI助手   |\n|             |      |    (49666)      |      |     (18888)       |      |             |\n+-------------+      +-----------------+      +-------------------+      +-------------+\n```\n\n### 路由规则\n详细工具路由请参考：[SKILL.md](./SKILL.md)"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":50192,"output":402,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50594,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772077301673}}
