-+      +-------------+\n```\n\n#### 2. MCP服务器模式（端口：49666）\n```\n+-------------+      +-----------------+      +-------------------+      +-------------+\n|             |      |                 |      |                   |      |             |\n|  浏览器扩展  +----->+  MCP服务器      +----->+  OpenClaw Gateway +----->+    AI助手   |\n|             |      |    (49666)      |      |     (18888)       |      |             |\n+-------------+      +-----------------+      +-------------------+      +-------------+\n```\n\n### 智能路由规则\n详细工具路由和架构选择请参考：[SKILL.md](./SKILL.md)"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":50954,"output":551,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51505,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772077415167}}
