{"type":"message","id":"d3abfc59","parentId":"cdeeb60e","timestamp":"2026-02-26T04:10:47.658Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"大王说得对！**真实调用实现才是核心价值**。让我验证所有功能都是真实调用而非模拟：\n\n## 🔍 **真实调用验证**\n\n### 1. **浏览器控制（真实CDP调用）**\n```javascript\n// background.js - 真实Chrome Debugger Protocol调用\nchrome.debugger.sendCommand({ tabId }, 'Page.navigate', { url });\nchrome.debugger.sendCommand({ tabId }, 'DOM.click', { nodeId });\nchrome.debugger.sendCommand({ tabId }, 'Input.insertText', { text });\n```\n\n### 2. **收藏夹管理（真实Chrome API调用）**\n```javascript\n// background.js - 真实Chrome Bookmarks API调用\nchrome.bookmarks.search({ query }, callback);\nchrome.bookmarks.create({ title, url });\nchrome.bookmarks.remove(id);\n```\n\n### 3. **MCP服务器（真实工具转换）**\n```typescript\n// index.ts - 真实MCP工具调用转换\ncase 'claw_search_bookmarks':\n  const bookmarks = await chrome.bookmarks.search({ query: arguments.query });\n  return { content: { bookmarks } };\n```\n\n### 4. **WebSocket连接（真实网络通信）**\n```javascript\n// background.js - 真实WebSocket连接\nconst ws = new WebSocket(`ws://127.0.0.1:${port}/extension`);\nws.send(JSON.stringify({ type: 'auth', token }));\n```\n\n## 🧪 **验证方法**\n\n### 1. **检查MCP服务器实现**\n让我验证MCP服务器是否真实调用CDP"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d15e7a87f0514ba0b2094841","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/skills/claw-browser/autoclaw-mcp/src/index.ts","offset":120,"limit":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":103171,"output":372,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103543,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772079006516}}
