{"type":"message","id":"f6842b4c","parentId":"df6f3130","timestamp":"2026-02-26T04:36:29.802Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                                         大王，看起来**MCP服务器没有收到HTTP请求**。让我检查服务器是否支持HTTP工具调用。\n\n实际上，MCP服务器主要通过**stdio协议**与OpenClaw通信，HTTP端点可能只是状态检查。\n\n## 🎯 **正确的调用方式**\n\n### 1. **通过OpenClaw Gateway调用**\n```bash\nopenclaw agent --message \"请打开抖音网站\"\n```\n\n### 2. **使用浏览器扩展直接操作**\n- 点击扩展图标\n- 授权连接\n- 使用语音或文字指令\n\n### 3. **通过MCP协议调用**\n（需要OpenClaw Gateway路由）\n\n## 🔧 **当前限制**\n\nMCP服务器的HTTP端点主要用于：\n- ✅ 健康检查 (`/health`)\n- ✅ 状态监控\n- ❌ 直接工具调用（需要通过OpenClaw Gateway）\n\n让我为您测试健康检查"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_63eab2fc47ec4fd0850fec0e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"Invoke-RestMethod -Uri \"http://127.0.0.1:49666/health\" -Method Get"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":68902,"output":221,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69123,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772080573880}}
