{"type":"message","id":"2227fe84","parentId":"399b4708","timestamp":"2026-02-26T04:42:02.206Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          大王，**最佳方案**如下：\n\n## 🎯 **最简洁有效架构**\n\n### 1. **单一Gateway服务**\n```bash\n# 启动Gateway（统一入口）\nopenclaw gateway --port 18789\n```\n\n### 2. **单一浏览器插件**\n- **插件**：通用版 (`autoclaw/`)\n- **端口**：`18789` (连接Gateway)\n- **Token**：`Q0hpK2oV4F9tlwbYX3RELxiJNGDvayr8OPqZzkfs`\n\n### 3. **自动MCP集成**\n- MCP服务器通过**stdio协议**自动注册到Gateway\n- 无需单独配置或运行\n- Gateway自动路由工具调用\n\n## 🔧 **立即执行步骤**\n\n### 1. **停止所有额外服务**\n```bash\n# 停止MCP HTTP服务器\n# 停止其他端口占用\n```\n\n### 2. **启动核心Gateway**\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway --port 18789\n```\n\n### 3. **配置浏览器插件**\n- 端口：`18789`\n- Token：`Q0hpK2oV4F9tlwbYX3RELxiJNGDvayr8OPqZzkfs`\n\n### 4. **正常使用**\n```bash\nopenclaw agent --message \"打开抖音\"\n```\n\n## ✅ **方案优势**\n\n### 极简：\n- ✅ 1个Gateway服务\n- ✅ 1个浏览器插件  \n- ✅ 1个连接端口\n- ✅ 1个认证Token\n\n### 高效：\n- ✅ 自动MCP工具集成\n- ✅ 自动路由和负载均衡\n- ✅ 官方标准架构\n\n### 稳定：\n- ✅ 无端口冲突\n- ✅ 无复杂配置\n- ✅ 无架构混乱\n\n大王，这就是**最简洁有效的方案**！所有复杂性都由OpenClaw框架自动处理，您只需要关注核心业务逻辑。🔥"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":73228,"output":418,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73646,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772080891447}}
